  m_text: '<size=42><b>ESCAPE MEKHANE</b></size>

    <b>DEVELOPMENT TEAM</b>



    Dustin
    Dean - Gameplay Systems, HUD, Scanner, UI, over world,

    Inventory, Crafting,
    and Level Integration

    Ray Blanco - UI and Level Design

    Justin Lewis
    - Player Movement and Design

    Christopher Stefanese - Enemy AI and Design



    <b>AI
    AND DEVELOPMENT TOOLS</b>

    ChatGPT by OpenAI - Programming, debugging, writing,
    and design assistance

    DALL-E by OpenAI - Concept art and visual asset generation

    Rodin
    - AI-assisted 3D model generation



    <b>SOUND EFFECTS</b>

    "Projectile
    Shoot" by Tobiasz "unfa" Karon - Freesound.org, CC0

    "Robot walk, looped"
    by Magnesus - Freesound.org, CC0



    <b>SPECIAL THANKS</b>

    Rob Moye -
    Instructor'
